==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|fr|thyroïde}} coined by {{w|Ambroise Paré}}, after {{der|en|grc|θυρεός|t=a large oblong shield}} + {{m|grc|εἶδος|t=a form, shape}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθaɪɹɔɪd/|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|thy|roid|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The [[thyroid gland]].
#* {{quote-web
|lang=en
|date=2013-08-09
|author=Douglas Main
|title=Israel Outlaws Water Fluoridation
|site=live science
|url=http://www.livescience.com/38796-israel-outlaws-water-fluoridation.html
|accessdate=2013-09-30
